Control Prime Display/UI Cleanup Task

The app is working, but some UI sizing and display areas need refinement for readability and layout stability.

PIX handling:
Read the PIX files as project instructions and context.
Do NOT delete, remove, rename, empty, or replace any PIX files.
Keep the PIX folder intact.
Only make code or UI changes that follow these notes.

Git identity note:
Arctic Prime uses the same GitHub account and email, but its local Git display name is:
git config --global user.name "Arctic Prime"

Control Prime should use the same GitHub account and email, but set its local Git display name to:
git config --global user.name "Control Prime"

Do NOT modify user.email, GitHub login, authentication, or remote URLs for this naming structure.

